# Loop ecosystem coordination

Full doc: `../AGENT_BRIEFS/ecosystem-coordination.md`

**Stack:** Loop-Core (specs) → loopnet (data) → LoopGym (run) → LoopBench (score). Loop-Engineering = narrative + Golden Path + adoption.

**Handoffs:** Spec changes → Loop-Core canonicalizes. New task → LoopGym env then LoopBench task then LE BEAT guide. LoopBench platform pack → edit `docs/ecosystem-sync/LoopBench/` first. Versions → `ECOSYSTEM_VERSIONS.md`.

**Never:** fake external adoption, auto-merge external LoopBench PRs, or count maintainer dry-runs as community proof.

When work spans repos, read the repo-specific brief in `../AGENT_BRIEFS/`.
